Road item `I1` at <<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road`>> carries the build; its order and its sibling items rest at <<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/face-intent-plane-record#/the-build`>>.

