<<~ ahu slot=`#/rulings`>>

!! Rulings

# Operator ruling 2026-10-20: the operator un-asked the daemon doc's whole position and kept one point pinned — //the daemon wiki reads pono; the operator and the AIs need a channel of intent through each PersonaGroup's fleet of device vessels.// A two-wave research pair read the field, and the operator approved the model the same day: //"Approve your leans, land the full models into the architecture now."//
# The operator's tension 2026-10-20, which the rubric answers: //every little action must not end up in each face's log; each keystroke replaces a cached invariant tiddler in memory with another, so a draft mid-edit does not belong.//

<<~/ahu>>

